WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Blanka places the light doll after the prerequisite corner knockdown.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.750
Standing medium kick precedes Jamie’s recorded grab attempt.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.000
OD Electric Thunder lands as Punish Counter and activates the doll.

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Heavy Backstep Rolling Attack continues the conversion.

5
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.150
Raw Drive Rush into standing heavy kick picks up Jamie.

6
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:14.350
OD Backstep Rolling Attack extends into Level 3.

7
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.400
The low-health Level 3 variant ends the punish.
